	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 3rd level, you may choose the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.zwxerg4avwdez81a]{Archery} or @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.3nhippsahwv78m11]{Dueling} fighting style in addition to your choice at level 1. If you choose, or already have, the Dueling style, it now functions even when you are holding a one-handed firearm in your off hand. In addition, you can now use Two-Weapon Fighting to make off-hand ranged attacks with a light caster or firearm and no longer gain disadvantage when using a light caster or firearm in melee so long as you have a melee weapon in your other hand.</p>",
